eywords, commissioning intent, or forecast dates. Missing forecast dates after observation for schedule_builder_specialist is Builder intake, not an orchestrator questionnaire. CREATE needs no baseline file; REVISE needs the attached package only.'};\nreturn [{json:{...x,planner_input:JSON.stringify(payload),specialist_catalog}}];"
